# Logs
# Anchored and directory-only: an unanchored `logs` also matches the
# src/features/Logs/ source directory on case-insensitive filesystems
# (git sets core.ignoreCase automatically on macOS and Windows), which
# silently drops it from commits and breaks the build on a clean checkout.
/logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
